OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FToday will be grey and murky,
OL,6,Fwith limited visibility at times, and
OL,7,Fspells of rain and drizzle which may
OL,8,Fhave occasional heavier outbreaks.
OL,9,FFeeling very mild and rather muggy.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FA short respite from the
OL,12,Fdamp, overcast weather is likely this
OL,13,Fevening for a few hours, but cloudy
OL,14,Fand drizzly interludes will return
OL,15,Fovernight.
OL,16,
OL,17,CTuesday:FA wet and windy start as
OL,18,Fheavy rain sweeps eastwards. Despite
OL,19,Fthe sunny spells, the afternoon will
OL,20,Ffeel cooler than on Monday with a
OL,21,Ffresh, gusty breeze following the rain.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
